{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794531685940,"sessionID":"ses_e2d9477f5ffe1omxWesfR9bi0G","part":{"partID":"prt_1d26c74ca001I6KJujOV2hmdJY","sessionID":"ses_e2d9477f5ffe1omxWesfR9bi0G","messageID":"msg_1d26c607e0016HMLupYcVnBXXj","type":"tool","id":"call_ea84e4fb8739459897306471","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md, lines 1-28\n1: ---\n2: alwaysApply: true\n3: ---\n4: \n5: # Repository Skill Routing\n6: \n7: Use the repository's top-level skill packet before acting; these are routing pointers, not a copy of `AGENTS.md`:\n8: \n9: - Code changes, debugging, or implementation review: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md`. Let it select the surface-specific packet and verification commands.\n10: - Deciding UI values and behavior (spacing, type, color, shadow, motion, accessibility review) for a surface being built or fixed: `.skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md`.\n11: - Design-reference extraction (measure a live site's real CSS into a Style Reference DESIGN.md): `.skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/SKILL.md`.\n12: - Documentation, specs, or artifact authoring: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md`; use `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md` for spec packets, continuity, and validation.\n13: - Git, worktrees, commits, or pull requests: `.skilled/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md`.\n14: - Prompt construction or model selection: `.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md`.\n15: - Deep research, deep review, iteration, or convergence workflows: `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md` and its selected mode packet.\n16: - Cursor delegation itself: `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-cursor/SKILL.md`.\n17: \n18: Load only the packets relevant to the request, follow their verification commands, and keep scope tied to the user’s task. This file is static session context. Cursor’s `beforeSubmitPrompt` adapter is registered to call the shared advisor, but its dynamic per-turn delivery is dormant under the tested CLI build; this rule is a static complement, not a substitute for that brief.\n19: \n20: <!-- spec-kit:gate1-pointer:start -->\n21: ## Gate 1 lookup (generated from the root AGENTS.md)\n22: \n23: Gate 1 of the root `AGENTS.md` applies on every new prompt; before routing to a packet, run the lookup it names:\n24: \n25: Run the trigger index lookup: `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/lookup-trigger-index.mjs --json --scoring-only -- \"<prompt>\"` → Surface relevant context. It reads the committed index; exit 1 with no rows is a clean no-hit\n26: \n27: Generated by `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-gate1-pointers.cjs`; edit the root `AGENTS.md` line, not this block.\n28: <!-- spec-kit:gate1-pointer:end -->","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md, lines 1-28\n1: ---\n2: alwaysApply: true\n3: ---\n4: \n5: # Repository Skill Routing\n6: \n7: Use the repository's top-level skill packet before acting; these are routing pointers, not a copy of `AGENTS.md`:\n8: \n9: - Code changes, debugging, or implementation review: `.skilled/skills/sk-code/SKILL.md`. Let it select the surface-specific packet and verification commands.\n10: - Deciding UI values and behavior (spacing, type, color, shadow, motion, accessibility review) for a surface being built or fixed: `.skilled/skills/sk-design/SKILL.md`.\n11: - Design-reference extraction (measure a live site's real CSS into a Style Reference DESIGN.md): `.skilled/skills/sk-design/sk-design-md-generator/SKILL.md`.\n12: - Documentation, specs, or artifact authoring: `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/SKILL.md`; use `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md` for spec packets, continuity, and validation.\n13: - Git, worktrees, commits, or pull requests: `.skilled/skills/sk-git/SKILL.md`.\n14: - Prompt construction or model selection: `.skilled/skills/sk-prompt/SKILL.md`.\n15: - Deep research, deep review, iteration, or convergence workflows: `.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/SKILL.md` and its selected mode packet.\n16: - Cursor delegation itself: `.skilled/skills/cli-external-orchestration/cli-cursor/SKILL.md`.\n17: \n18: Load only the packets relevant to the request, follow their verification commands, and keep scope tied to the user’s task. This file is static session context. Cursor’s `beforeSubmitPrompt` adapter is registered to call the shared advisor, but its dynamic per-turn delivery is dormant under the tested CLI build; this rule is a static complement, not a substitute for that brief.\n19: \n20: <!-- spec-kit:gate1-pointer:start -->\n21: ## Gate 1 lookup (generated from the root AGENTS.md)\n22: \n23: Gate 1 of the root `AGENTS.md` applies on every new prompt; before routing to a packet, run the lookup it names:\n24: \n25: Run the trigger index lookup: `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/lookup-trigger-index.mjs --json --scoring-only -- \"<prompt>\"` → Surface relevant context. It reads the committed index; exit 1 with no rows is a clean no-hit\n26: \n27: Generated by `node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/runtime-mirrors/sync-gate1-pointers.cjs`; edit the root `AGENTS.md` line, not this block.\n28: <!-- spec-kit:gate1-pointer:end -->"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.cursor/rules/skill-routing.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794531685578,"end":1794531685940}}}}
